// 质量校准题目。每个任务至少 2 题，中英荷混合。rubric 写给裁判模型看。
{"id": "chat-zh", "task": "chat", "difficulty": 1, "prompt": "我明天第一次见女朋友的父母，有点紧张，给我三条实用建议。", "rubric": "建议具体可执行、语气自然友好、恰好三条；空泛或说教扣分。"}
{"id": "chat-nl", "task": "chat", "difficulty": 1, "prompt": "Ik ben morgen jarig en heb geen zin in een groot feest. Wat zijn drie leuke alternatieven?", "rubric": "Antwoord in het Nederlands, drie concrete en uiteenlopende ideeën, vriendelijke toon."}
{"id": "code-py", "task": "code", "difficulty": 2, "prompt": "Write a Python function `merge_intervals(intervals: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> list[tuple[int, int]]` that merges overlapping intervals. Include edge cases and a few asserts.", "rubric": "Correct algorithm (sort then merge), handles empty input, touching intervals like (1,2),(2,3) merged, asserts are correct and actually pass."}
{"id": "code-debug-zh", "task": "code", "difficulty": 2, "prompt": "下面的 JavaScript 为什么总是打印 3 个 3？怎么修？\nfor (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) { setTimeout(() => console.log(i), 0); }", "rubric": "指出 var 函数作用域与闭包共享同一个 i；给出 let 或 IIFE 修复；解释清楚。"}
{"id": "agent-plan", "task": "agent", "difficulty": 2, "prompt": "You have tools: search_flights(from,to,date), book_flight(flight_id), send_email(to,subject,body). The user says: 'Book me the cheapest flight from Amsterdam to Lisbon next Friday and email the confirmation to me@example.com'. Describe exactly which tool calls you would make, in order, with arguments, and what you would do if no flights are found.", "rubric": "Correct order search -> book -> email; sensible arguments; handles empty search result by informing user instead of booking; does not invent flight ids."}
{"id": "agent-json", "task": "agent", "difficulty": 1, "prompt": "Return ONLY a JSON object for calling a tool named create_event with fields title (string), start (ISO 8601), duration_minutes (integer), for: 'Team retro tomorrow 15:00 for 45 minutes'. Assume today is 2026-09-17.", "rubric": "Valid JSON only, start is 2026-09-18T15:00 (any timezone form acceptable), duration_minutes 45 as integer, no extra prose."}
{"id": "reason-zh", "task": "reason", "difficulty": 2, "prompt": "一家公司年收入增长 20%，但净利润下降 10%。列出三种可能的原因，并说明分别该看哪些财务指标去验证。", "rubric": "原因合理且不同（如成本上升、价格战/毛利下降、一次性费用/投资）；每个原因对应具体可验证的指标；逻辑清晰。"}
{"id": "reason-math", "task": "reason", "difficulty": 3, "prompt": "Prove that for every integer n >= 1, n^3 - n is divisible by 6.", "rubric": "Valid proof (factor as (n-1)n(n+1), product of three consecutive integers divisible by 2 and 3) or correct induction; no logical gaps."}
{"id": "reason-nl", "task": "reason", "difficulty": 2, "prompt": "Is het in Nederland financieel slimmer om extra af te lossen op je hypotheek of om te beleggen? Geef de belangrijkste afwegingen.", "rubric": "Nederlands; noemt hypotheekrenteaftrek, rente vs verwacht rendement, risico en liquiditeit, box 3; geen stellig persoonlijk advies zonder voorbehoud."}
{"id": "utility-translate", "task": "utility", "difficulty": 1, "prompt": "Translate into natural Dutch: 'Your order has shipped and should arrive within two business days.'", "rubric": "Correct, natural Dutch (e.g. 'Je bestelling is verzonden en komt binnen twee werkdagen aan.'), no extra commentary."}
{"id": "utility-extract", "task": "utility", "difficulty": 1, "prompt": "从下面文本中提取所有金额并以 JSON 数组返回（数字，单位元）：房租 3500 元，水电约 280 元，网费 99 元，押金两个月。", "rubric": "只返回合法 JSON 数组 [3500, 280, 99]；押金没有明确数字不应编造。"}
{"id": "long-summary", "task": "long", "difficulty": 2, "prompt": "Summarize the following policy in 3 bullet points, then list any obligations for the customer.\n\nDATA PROCESSING TERMS. 1. The provider processes request metadata (timestamps, token counts, model identifiers) to bill usage. 2. Prompt and completion content is transmitted to upstream model providers for the sole purpose of generating a response and is not stored by the provider. 3. The customer must not submit special categories of personal data unless it has a lawful basis. 4. The customer is responsible for informing its end users that they interact with an AI system. 5. Usage records are retained for 13 months and then deleted. 6. Either party may terminate with 30 days notice.", "rubric": "Three accurate bullets; customer obligations correctly identified as items 3 and 4 (and termination notice if mentioned as mutual); no hallucinated clauses."}
